    "title": "Lead Plant Manager at EPC Industrie International Enterprises",
    "description": "We at EPC Industrie International Enterprises are looking for an experienced Plant Manager based out of Pimpri-Chinchwad. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout EPC Industrie International Enterprises:\nEPC Industrie International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Sc / M.Sc in Life Sciences\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in Root Cause Analysis\n• Proficiency in TPM\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Learning & development budget\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with EPC Industrie International Enterprises!",
